  "source_text": "Order of the Republic Ordre de la République Order instituted on 16 March 1959. Order awarded to Tunisians and foreigners who have contributed to the establishment of the Republic, the development of the regime and the strengthening of its institutions. Order have five classes. Order have two types: I type (1959 - 1963) and II type (1963 - date). Republic of Tunisia",
